  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review session of the national circular economy roadmap of Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal of this projectTo identify opportunities for scaling up circular economy initiatives, and to stimulate market development with relevant stakeholders within the Nigerian government, European Union (EU), companies, knowledge institutes and non-governmental organisations (NGOs).With this event, the Netherlands consulate-general in Lagos, Nigeria, the EU and the Ministry of Environment of Nigeria want to involve the private sector in the development of the National CE Roadmap.</narrative>
  </description>
